4
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:05,950
{\fad(100,600)\fn方正苏新诗柳楷繁体\pos(950,690)\fs55\1c&HB8D3EC&}Subtitled by Queen Medusa
[Telegram] - ({Donghua_Sigmas)

5
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:36,700
یواش‌تر!

6
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:37,900
سر و صدا نکنید، این همه سر و صدا برای چیه؟

7
00:02:37,900 --> 00:02:39,100
خیلی خب، خیلی خب، بدش من!

8
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:41,100
کافیه.

9
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:49,500
شیائوفان!

10
00:02:49,900 --> 00:02:50,900
هنوز توی رختخوابی؟

11
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:52,300
خورشید کلی بالا اومده!

12
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:53,100
تو تنبل.

13
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:54,300
خواهر کوچک‌تر...

14
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:55,300
اول صبحی برای چی داد و بیداد راه اندختی؟

15
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:56,100
خواهر ارشد.

16
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:57,300
برادر ارشد.

17
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:58,700
بذار ببینم چیکار داره میکنه.

18
00:03:01,620 --> 00:03:02,980
هفتمی...

19
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:48,740
Nooo!

20
00:03:49,850 --> 00:03:52,860
{\fad(100,600)\fnHey Comic\pos(970,610)\fs80}Episode 01 (E79)

21
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:58,720
{\pos(560,200)\1c&H715B45&\1a&H80&\3c&H3642B5&\3a&H00&\bord3\shad0\p1}m -230 -40 l -200 -60 l 200 -60 l 230 -40 l 230 40 l 200 60 l -200 60 l -230 40{\p0}

22
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:58,720
{\fnAaLingSheZhuan\pos(330,110)\c&H629AC4&\3c&H111111&\bord4\blur8\fs70}فرقه کینگ‌یون

23
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:01,700
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3642B5&\bord2\blur15}As long as the Beast Deity remains alive,

24
00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:03,700
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3642B5&\bord2\blur15}he will forever be a scourge upon this world.

25
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:06,300
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3642B5&\bord2\blur15}I will never allow this nightmare...

26
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,500
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3642B5&\bord2\blur15}...to become a reality.

27
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:19,900
Ever since Little Junior Sister Ling'er got married...

28
00:04:19,900 --> 00:04:21,700
...it’s been a long time since things were this lively around here.

29
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:21,600
{\pos(560,200)\1c&H75A9D6&\1a&H80&\3c&H3F688F&\3a&H00&\bord2\shad0\p1}m -230 -30 l -200 -45 l 200 -45 l 230 -30 l 230 30 l 200 45 l -200 45 l -230 30{\p0}

30
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:21,600
{\fnAaLingSheZhuan\pos(330,140)\c&H252322&\3c&H9BBDE0&\bord3\blur4\fs60}Observed Silence Hall

31
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:23,700
You rascal monkey!

32
00:04:24,090 --> 00:04:24,900
Stupid dog!

33
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:35,500
What are we going to do?!

34
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:36,900
Get down from there right now!

35
00:04:40,300 --> 00:04:41,090
That was close!

36
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:44,000
I've got it!

37
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,480
I've got it!

38
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:47,500
I've got it too!

39
00:04:48,090 --> 00:04:48,700
Catch him!

40
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:50,700
I can still catch it!

41
00:04:58,700 --> 00:04:59,500
We're doomed... we are so doomed!

42
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:00,500
Now we're really in for it.

43
00:05:01,300 --> 00:05:02,500
Paying respects to Master!

44
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:05,500
Let them be.

45
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:15,000
You tell him.

46
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:16,100
Why didn't you mention...

47
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:17,900
...that other than this monkey,

48
00:05:18,700 --> 00:05:19,680
you and Lao Liu...

49
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:21,500
...didn't see any sign of anyone else?

50
00:05:22,100 --> 00:05:22,400
Well...

51
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:22,800
No...

52
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:23,800
There wasn't.

53
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:27,900
Alright.

54
00:05:28,700 --> 00:05:29,300
All of you, step outside.

55
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:29,800
Yes!

56
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:33,100
Do you think هفتمی...

57
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:39,700
Do you think Old Seventh might be somewhere nearby?

58
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:42,300
You know how he is.

59
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:44,300
He has always valued his emotional bonds above all else.

60
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:46,300
If he truly wished to see you again...

61
00:05:46,700 --> 00:05:48,100
...it would only be natural.

62
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:49,700
It's just that...

63
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:51,100
...given his current identity,

64
00:05:51,700 --> 00:05:53,100
he likely wouldn't dare show himself.

65
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:56,700
I know what you're worried about.

66
00:05:57,100 --> 00:05:58,900
That day outside the Illusion Moon Cave...

67
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:00,900
Even though he was wounded by the Zhu Xian Sword,

68
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:03,100
he survived in the end.

69
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:05,100
Furthermore, rumors say...

70
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:07,300
...his accomplices managed to spirit him away.

71
00:06:07,700 --> 00:06:09,500
When Daren reported back to us,

72
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:14,000
{\fn方正苏新诗柳楷繁体\pos(450,70)\fs30\1c&HB8D3EC&}TN: "Xiao Hui" translates to "Little Gray" (the monkey), and
"Da Huang" means "Big Yellow" (the dog).

73
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:11,700
he mentioned that Xiao Hui wasn't by his side.

74
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:12,700
Perhaps...

75
00:06:13,100 --> 00:06:14,900
...he anticipated the immense danger ahead,

76
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:16,900
and deliberately left Xiao Hui behind.

77
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:19,500
The fact that Xiao Hui has returned to Big Bamboo Peak...

78
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:21,500
doesn't it prove that deep down in his heart,

79
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:22,900
that child still considers this place...

80
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:24,900
...to be his final home?

81
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,000
That foolish brat...

82
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:27,500
What did you say?

83
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:31,500
Damn monkey!

84
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:33,500
One of these days I'm going to skin you alive,

85
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:34,500
then let's see if you can keep eating!

86
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:38,500
This is absolute disrespect!

87
00:06:38,900 --> 00:06:41,500
Now even a dog dares to jump out and bark at me!

88
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:42,500
Lao Liu!

89
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:43,900
Master!

90
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:45,100
What are your orders?

91
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:46,400
Today at noon...

92
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:48,700
...you slaughter that stupid dog for me.

93
00:06:48,900 --> 00:06:50,100
I want him stewed in a pot for lunch!

94
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:51,900
I've wasted years raising this useless mutt,

95
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:52,500
Well...

96
00:06:52,500 --> 00:06:53,700
and he's still completely worthless in the end!

97
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:57,300
Hey!

98
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:58,500
What are you all laughing at?!

99
00:06:58,500 --> 00:06:58,900
These...

100
00:06:58,900 --> 00:07:00,700
These are direct orders from Master!

101
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:02,700
What on earth am I supposed to do?!

102
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:05,500
Junior Brother,

103
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:08,500
this is an important task entrusted to you by Master.

104
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:10,900
You must see it through properly.

105
00:07:12,300 --> 00:07:14,900
Who are you kidding?! Everyone knows Master’s favorite is Da Huang!

106
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:16,300
And now this...

107
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:19,100
If I actually followed Master's orders...

108
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:20,500
when he inevitably regrets it later,

109
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:21,900
would I even survive the day?!

110
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:25,500
Lao Liu,

111
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:27,700
you truly are a clever one.

112
00:07:27,900 --> 00:07:29,100
You understand Master's true intentions perfectly.

113
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:30,500
Since that's the case...

114
00:07:30,900 --> 00:07:32,300
just ignore Master's orders and you'll be fine.

115
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:36,900
However, what Master hates the most is when we disciples disobey his commands.

116
00:07:37,300 --> 00:07:41,100
Once Master finds out that Lao Liu dared to treat his words like wind past his ears...

117
00:07:41,340 --> 00:07:42,100
well...

118
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,300
You disloyal bastards!

119
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:47,700
Sooner or later, you'll get your retribution!

120
00:07:59,300 --> 00:08:00,300
Could it be that one of my senior brothers...

121
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:02,700
...is actually playing a trick on me at a time like this?

122
00:08:08,900 --> 00:08:09,700
Could it be...

123
00:08:22,100 --> 00:08:23,700
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB469FF&\bord2\blur15}This journey is fraught with extreme danger.

124
00:08:24,300 --> 00:08:25,900
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB469FF&\bord2\blur15}If any mishap befalls you...

125
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,000
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFCC55&\bord2\blur15}I...

126
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:31,300
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFCC55&\bord2\blur15}This disciple has been nurtured and taught by our sect.

127
00:08:32,100 --> 00:08:33,100
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFCC55&\bord2\blur15}It is my duty to protect the common people.

128
00:08:34,100 --> 00:08:36,100
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFCC55&\bord2\blur15}Compared to the safety of the world,

129
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:37,900
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFCC55&\bord2\blur15}what does the life or death of one person matter?

130
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:41,900
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB469FF&\bord2\blur15}Fine.

131
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:43,900
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB469FF&\bord2\blur15}Go then.

132
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:49,900
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB469FF&\bord2\blur15}I only hope you remember...

133
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:52,700
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB469FF&\bord2\blur15}With Tianya in hand,

134
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:55,100
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB469FF&\bord2\blur15}sever the illusions of this world.

135
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,700
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB469FF&\bord2\blur15}Do not fail the common people,

136
00:08:58,700 --> 00:09:00,290
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HB469FF&\bord2\blur15}and do not fail the cry of your sword.

137
00:09:22,900 --> 00:09:23,500
Xueqi,

138
00:09:23,900 --> 00:09:24,500
what's wrong?

139
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:27,500
This journey to the Southern Border is incredibly dangerous.

140
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:29,100
If you have any reservations...

141
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:30,100
Senior Sister,

142
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:30,700
I am fine.

143
00:09:33,100 --> 00:09:33,700
Senior Sisters,

144
00:09:34,100 --> 00:09:34,500
let us depart.

145
00:09:55,700 --> 00:10:00,000
{\fn方正苏新诗柳楷繁体\pos(550,70)\fs30\1c&HB8D3EC&}TN: The Donghua altered the novel's "Miao Tribe" to the elemental
"Gold Tribe" (Jin Zu) to avoid real world ethnic references.

146
00:09:55,700 --> 00:09:58,900
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H55E64B&\bord2\blur15}In the future, if the Gold Tribe ever faces a calamity...

147
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:02,290
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H55E64B&\bord2\blur15}I hope you can offer your protection.

148
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:03,900
{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H55E64B&\bord2\blur15}Will you?

149
00:10:05,290 --> 00:10:05,900
Esteemed Guest,

150
00:10:06,100 --> 00:10:07,100
please follow me.

151
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:31,900
I am the Gold Tribe's new generation Great Shaman.

152
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:33,700
Master Ghost Li,

153
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:35,100
I have long heard of your great name.

154
00:10:37,100 --> 00:10:38,100
The Great Shaman, he...

155
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:41,300
According to the customs of the Gold Tribe,

156
00:10:41,900 --> 00:10:43,300
after the death of the Great Shaman,

157
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:46,000
{\fn方正苏新诗柳楷繁体\pos(450,80)\fs30\1c&HB8D3EC&}TN: The tribes of the Southern Border worship primal animal totems.
The Dog Deity (犬神) is the sacred guardian spirit of the Gold Tribe.

158
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:46,100
they must be worshipped beneath the Dog Deity statue for a year.

159
00:10:46,900 --> 00:10:47,300
These...

160
00:10:47,700 --> 00:10:49,300
These are my master's ashes.

161
00:11:00,100 --> 00:11:02,100
If I hadn't insisted on the Great Shaman leaving with me,

162
00:11:02,700 --> 00:11:04,700
perhaps he wouldn't have perished in a foreign land.

163
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:07,700
Every time I think of this,

164
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:09,700
my heart knows no peace.

165
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:12,300
Master had told me long ago

166
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:14,100
that he had reached the end of his lifespan.

167
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:15,900
Even if he hadn't gone to the Central Plains,

168
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:17,500
he still couldn't have avoided death.

169
00:11:19,700 --> 00:11:20,500
Moreover, your honorable sect

170
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:22,900
specially sent someone to return Master's ashes.

171
00:11:23,300 --> 00:11:24,100
We deeply appreciate the gesture.

172
00:11:24,700 --> 00:11:25,700
Those things...

173
00:11:26,100 --> 00:11:27,500
were done by other sincere people.

174
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:29,900
It had nothing to do with me.

175
00:11:38,300 --> 00:11:38,900
I wonder,

176
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:40,700
Mr. Ghost Li, what is the reason

177
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:41,900
for your visit today?

178
00:11:42,300 --> 00:11:43,500
Although the Beast Deity was heavily injured,

179
00:11:44,300 --> 00:11:45,500
he managed to escape with his broken body

180
00:11:45,700 --> 00:11:46,500
and has vanished without a trace.

181
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:50,300
I intend to put an absolute end to this scourge.

182
00:11:51,300 --> 00:11:53,100
Do you happen to have any clues?

183
00:11:53,700 --> 00:11:54,700
Can you kill him?

184
00:11:55,300 --> 00:11:56,900
I am willing to give it everything I have.

185
00:11:59,500 --> 00:12:00,900
Master Ghost Li, your righteous heart

186
00:12:01,700 --> 00:12:02,700
commands my deep respect.

187
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:04,500
Since that is the case,

188
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:05,900
I will tell you everything

189
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:06,700
that I know.

190
00:12:08,100 --> 00:12:09,500
According to our tribe's secret scrolls,

191
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:11,300
the Beast Deity's origins are unknown,

192
00:12:11,700 --> 00:12:12,900
but he is exceptionally powerful.

193
00:12:13,300 --> 00:12:14,300
He is immortal and indestructible.

194
00:12:14,900 --> 00:12:17,100
He can only be sealed and suppressed,

195
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:19,100
just as the Shaman Goddess did ten thousand years ago.

196
00:12:19,900 --> 00:12:20,900
The five divine weapons

197
00:12:21,300 --> 00:12:22,700
are the source of the Beast Deity's life.

198
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:24,900
As long as you manage to strip them from him,

199
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:26,100
the Beast Deity...

200
00:12:26,500 --> 00:12:28,300
will naturally fall back into a deep slumber.

201
00:12:29,100 --> 00:12:30,500
But subduing the Beast Deity

202
00:12:30,700 --> 00:12:31,900
is no easy task.

203
00:12:33,100 --> 00:12:34,100
Back then, the Shaman Goddess

204
00:12:34,100 --> 00:12:35,300
relied on an ancient, wondrous formation

205
00:12:35,700 --> 00:12:36,900
the Eight Savage Inferno Formation

206
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:38,500
to finally trap him.

207
00:12:39,700 --> 00:12:40,900
If you can find it...

208
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:41,900
perhaps...

209
00:12:42,900 --> 00:12:44,700
The Eight Savage Inferno Formation.

210
00:12:46,500 --> 00:12:48,860
It seems I need to make a trip to Burning Incense Valley.

211
00:12:50,100 --> 00:12:51,100
Legend says,

212
00:12:51,300 --> 00:12:53,100
the place where the Shaman Goddess sealed the Beast Deity

213
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:55,900
is the Subdue Devil Cave, deep within the Ten Thousand Great Mountains.

214
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:57,300
In that cave,

215
00:12:57,500 --> 00:12:59,900
you might find clues regarding the formation and the beast demon.

216
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:04,700
Thank you.

217
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:19,300
Seven Miles Cave has suffered such a devastating calamity.

218
00:13:20,300 --> 00:13:21,900
Countless tribespeople have lost their families and homes.

219
00:13:23,100 --> 00:13:24,100
Why is it that the Great Shaman...

220
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:26,900
shows no trace of sorrow in his eyes?

221
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:30,700
The dead are gone,

222
00:13:31,300 --> 00:13:32,300
but the living...

223
00:13:32,500 --> 00:13:33,900
still have days ahead they must endure.

224
00:13:35,300 --> 00:13:36,900
If I lose myself in grief and despair...

225
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:38,300
then who...

226
00:13:38,900 --> 00:13:40,700
will be left to take care of my people?

227
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:02,000
Back when the Dark Fire Chains were undone,

228
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:04,600
this place sustained heavy damage.

229
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:14,000
This is...

230
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,000
It's been a long time.

231
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,000
Not only has your cultivation advanced, Young Master,

232
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:32,000
but your mind has grown even sharper, hasn't it?

233
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,600
What are you doing here?

234
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:37,200
I've been waiting here for you.

235
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,600
Waiting for me? For what?

236
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:41,600
And how did you know I would come here?

237
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,200
Could it be you've already forgotten?

238
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,600
The last time you were here...

239
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,600
...you came with me.

240
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:50,400
I heard you were tracking the Beast Deity.

241
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,600
According to the legends of the Southern Border,

242
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,200
to seal and suppress the Beast Deity,

243
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:56,800
you naturally cannot do without the formation in this place.

244
00:14:57,400 --> 00:14:58,600
If you didn't come here,

245
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:00,800
where else could you go?

246
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,000
You see...

247
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,200
aren't I clever?

248
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,800
How long has it been?

249
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,400
Xun'er is not an outsider.

250
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,800
{\fn方正苏新诗柳楷繁体\pos(900,40)\fs38\1c&HB8D3EC&}TN : FenXiang Valley = Burning Incense Valley

251
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,800
He will take over Burning Incense Valley in the future.

252
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:29,000
There is no need to hide these matters from him.

253
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,200
From the time our preparations were complete

254
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:33,200
and the official summoning began,

255
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,200
up until today...

256
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:36,400
it has been exactly thirty days.

257
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,000
The Red Fire Brilliant Elder...

258
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:39,400
has not responded at all.

259
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:41,800
That day, when the lava erupted,

260
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,600
it caused far too much damage to the formation.

261
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:45,400
The spiritual energy our Burning Incense Valley...

262
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:47,800
...spent hundreds of years accumulating here

263
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,000
has already been completely exhausted.

264
00:15:49,700 --> 00:15:52,200
Add to that the loss of the formation's key, the Inferno Mirror...

265
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:53,600
It truly is...

266
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:56,000
The formation within the Inferno Altar

267
00:15:56,200 --> 00:16:00,000
was constructed by our sect's ancestors based
on the records in the Burning Incense Jade Tome.

268
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:05,000
{\fn方正苏新诗柳楷繁体\pos(740,140)\fs30\1c&HB8D3EC&}TN : Burning Incense Jade Tome (焚香玉册 - Fénxiāng Yùcè) - Translated as "Tome" rather than "Book" to reflect its ancient, high fantasy weight. This is the supreme cultivation manual of Burning Incense Valley. Its darkest
secret is the Inferno Altar's forbidden formation, which uses the Inferno Mirror to summon
the world-ending Eight Desolation Fire Dragon.

269
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:02,000
At the very end of the Jade Tome,

270
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:05,000
a forefather once left behind a highly risky method.

271
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:07,800
The Inferno Formation is born of the world's vicious energies,

272
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:10,200
the Red Fire Beast is savage and brutal,

273
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:14,200
and the spirits housed within the formation's engravings are
the Eight Savage Ferocious Deities.

274
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:15,800
Deducing from this,

275
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:19,200
and referencing ancient Southern Border texts, if we sacrifice the blood of living humans...

276
00:16:19,800 --> 00:16:21,200
the vicious energy will surge,

277
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:22,800
the deities will return to their rightful places,

278
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,600
the ferocious beast will manifest,

279
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:27,200
and the fire formation will be complete!

280
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:29,000
This...

281
00:16:29,800 --> 00:16:32,000
Was this truly written by our sect's ancestor?

282
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:35,800
Are you suspecting that I am using our forefather's name as a pretext

283
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:37,800
to commit this evil deed?!

284
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:39,800
I wouldn't dare.

285
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:40,600
It's just...

286
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:43,200
It's just that this act of sacrificing the blood of living humans

287
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,200
is clearly a dark art of the Evil Sect!

288
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:46,200
How...

289
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:48,600
How could it possibly appear within our sect's Jade Tome?!

290
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:49,800
You are not wrong.

291
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:52,800
Although this forefather wrote these words,

292
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:55,200
no one has ever attempted it.

293
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:56,800
Senior Brother!

294
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,400
The grand scheme is naturally important,

295
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:00,000
but this method...

296
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,000
is simply going too far!

297
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:01,600
Junior Brother.

298
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:03,600
The Inferno Altar was damaged,

299
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:05,790
and we are now trapped in this dire predicament.

300
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,790
Do you truly think you bear no blame for this?

301
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:13,790
We have already obtained three of the Four Divinities.

302
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:16,000
{\fn方正苏新诗柳楷繁体\pos(970,80)\fs33\1c&HB8D3EC&}TN: The Four Divinities are ancient mythical beasts: Kui Niu (Thunder Beast), Yellow Bird (Huang Niao), TaoTie (Gluttonous Beast),
and ZhuLong (Torch Dragon). The Ghost King is hunting them to activate the apocalyptic Four Divinities Blood Formation.

303
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:16,400
As long as we capture the ferocious beast, TaoTie...

304
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:17,400
...this world...

305
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:20,200
...will be entirely within the Sect Master's grasp.

306
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:23,000
I have already dispatched our people to handle this matter.

307
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,000
I presume...

308
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:27,400
